Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] Add runnable scoped native annotation composition

Checkpoint remains inert: no web startup or default-ON activation yet. Reuse canonical detached Kanban projection, strict native external capture, registry lifecycle wakes and exact-profile source contexts. Seeded source and output readiness precedes process-wide legacy drain; one rollback callback across profile bindings.

Proof: canonical runner 9 files / 129 passed / 0 failed; whole-tree scripts/check --base origin/main green. Real two-profile stores exercise all seven decorated families under request I/O tripwires and exactly-once drain/rollback. Real board mutation and registry-only completion feed tests green. Cold batch demand RED/GREEN. Native strict external read failures RED/GREEN. Remaining: capture hard bounds/watch inventory, resident demand eviction, scoped web lifecycle and full acceptance/live proof.
